repair = "Assert length 51, preserve the exact independently recorded runtime bytes, require equality with the keeper runtime and pin its Keccak-256 to the staged guarded identity in sdk/launchpad/shared/config/deployment/manifest.go; retain every Treasury ABI, event, deposit, role and refusal assertion."
